This function runs once per session and is where the range stops being a moving target and becomes an immutable measured object. ATR is sampled at this exact moment rather than recomputed later, so every normalized column in the file shares one consistent volatility reference. The previous day's levels and the prior lookback high and low are captured here too, giving us the structural context the breakout will happen in. As the analysis will show, that context matters more than several features we might have expected to dominate.
Opening an event
