Running the Logger
We attached the logger to GBPUSD on M15 in Session mode (Tokyo) and ran it in the Strategy Tester from January 2025 to August 2026. For this run, InpLogTF was set to M15; all figures below assume that setting. The full run recorded 419 events. However, the statistical analysis from the baseline was performed on a systematic sample of 42 of those events—every tenth row by EventID—so the numbers that follow describe that sample, not the full set, and should be read as indicative rather than settled.
The journal summary printed at the end of the run is the first sanity check. It reports how many events were recorded, how they split across outcomes, and how the average range width, volume ratio, and breakout distance differ between winners and losers. If those three averages had come back identical across outcome groups, we would have known immediately that our chosen features carry no information, and the honest next step would have been to change the features rather than proceed. They did not come back identical.
